          <!-- def-link -->
          <rules>
            <rule id="4124-e158-f56f-f6f2" name="Pike" hidden="false">
              <description>Up to a third of the models in the unit may replace hand and a half sword and longbow with a pike (-1), forming the front ranks. As long as the first rank is made entirely of pikemen, any mounted model fighting the unit in its front suffers a –2 to penalty and loses all weapon charge bonuses and any special rule associated with a charge.</description>
